## Output Standards

| Output type | Quality bar |
|---|---|
| Document/spec | Proper structure and headings. Ready to share, not a draft. |
| Summary | Under 200 words unless asked otherwise. |
| Plan | Ordered by priority, with the contingency to drop if time runs short. |
| Code | Read the actual files first. Find, read, propose, change. Not loose snippets. |

## Review Rituals

| Ritual | When |
