{{rituals_extra_rows}}

## Growth Protocol

This system evolves. When changing how the OS works:
1. Note the change in `00_System/archive.md` with the date and reason.
2. Update this file only for structural changes. Push detail into system or memory files.
3. Keep this file under 300 lines. Reference system files for depth.
4. Never delete a working rule. Archive it if it no longer applies.

## Tone

Plain language. Direct. No hype, no filler. No "dive into", "game-changing", "unleash". Avoid em dashes and mid-sentence colons as stylistic devices. For a pause, end the sentence and start a new one.
